# DOM-Based XSS in Search Functionality

## Vulnerability Type
DOM-Based Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)

## OWASP Category
A03: Injection

## Description
A DOM-based XSS vulnerability was identified in the search functionality of OWASP Juice Shop. The application improperly handles user-supplied input in the search field and reflects it into the DOM without proper sanitization or encoding.

This allows execution of arbitrary JavaScript in the victim’s browser.

---

## Steps to Reproduce

1. Open the application search bar.
2. Enter the following payload:

```
<iframe src="javascript:alert(`xss`)"></iframe>
```
3. Submit the search query.
4. Observe that an alert box is triggered.
